[{"id":"CN-IP-014","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["端口","四元组"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/"}],"articleIndex":14,"articleCount":17,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么相同的端口号不代表相同的 TCP/UDP 会话？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>协议、源/目标 IP 和源/目标端口共同确定端点关系；TCP 与 UDP 还属于不同传输空间。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>TCP 192.168.10.10:53000 到 198.51.100.20:443 与 UDP 使用同样数字端口，也不是同一会话。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>会话识别可以写成：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">(protocol, source IP, source port, destination IP, destination port)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>相同数字端口只占一个字段；协议或任一地址不同，观察到的连接/数据报上下文就可能不同。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-TR-FAQ-001","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","字节流","消息边界"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":15,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>TCP 能保证消息一次完整到达吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能。TCP 提供有序字节流；一次写入可能被拆成多个段，一次读取也可能得到半条或多条应用消息。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>应用协议需要自己定义长度、分隔符或帧格式。TCP 的可靠性不等于保留应用消息边界。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>应用协议必须自行划分消息，例如：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">[4 字节长度][payload]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">或\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">[一行一条消息\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">或\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">[BEGIN][内容][END]\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>TCP 只保证字节按序到达；一次 send() 与一次 recv() 没有一一对应关系。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a2-type-which","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["命令解析","排障"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(二)系统与命令行基础.md","articleTitle":"Linux(二)系统与命令行基础","articlePath":"posts/6153b09f/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":7,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么排查命令来源优先用 type -a，而不是只用 which？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>type -a 能识别别名、函数、内建和多个外部路径；which 通常只查 PATH 中的外部文件。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>例如，别名会在 PATH 搜索之前生效：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">alias\u003c/span> ll=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;ls -lh&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">type\u003c/span> -a ll       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 先看到 alias\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">type\u003c/span> -a \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ls\u003c/span>       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 可能同时看到 builtin 和外部路径\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">command\u003c/span> -v \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">ls\u003c/span>    \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 脚本中只需要“能否调用”时使用\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>因此 \u003ccode>which\u003c/code> 找不到的并不一定是“不能执行”，它可能是 Shell 内建或函数；脚本判断仍应使用 POSIX 的 \u003ccode>command -v\u003c/code>，交互排障则用 \u003ccode>type -a\u003c/code> 看完整解析链。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-scenario-cart-journey","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["场景","购物车","一致性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(十)功能测试场景训练","articlePath":"posts/c75ad281/"}],"articleIndex":10,"articleCount":14,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>如何测试购物车从游客到结算的完整流程？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先确认游客持久化和登录合并规则，再覆盖勾选、库存/价格变化、重进和结算前后的数据一致性。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>代表轨迹包括游客加购后登录合并、登录账号已有同品、取消勾选、库存下降、价格更新、刷新和跨页面重进。预期写购物车数量、价格、库存提示、结算金额和账号隔离；合并冲突必须有明确规则。多设备同时修改属于追问，不能只用单浏览器流程推断。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]